    "chunk_text": "ia\u00f0 grecisce naman and nevtri generis: nominativo hoc poema \u00f0es leo\u00f0cr\u00e6ft, genitivo Ealswa ga\u00f0 \u00f0as naman: hoc cauma swolo\u00f0, thema antimber, scema hiw, onoma nama, malagma Seo o\u00f0er geendung is on scortne e, and \u00f0a naman, \u00fee on \u00f0\u00e6re geendia\u00f0, synd ealle nevtri generis: hoc Ealswa ga\u00f0 \u00f0as: hoc monile \u00fees myne, cubile denn, ouile eowd, praesaepe binn, mare s\u00e6. And ealle hi geendia\u00fe ablativvm on i, buton gausape beodcla\u00f0, ab hoc gausape, and rete nett, ab hoc Seo \u00f0ridde geendung ys on scortne o. On \u00f0\u00e6re geendia\u00f0 manega naman: agene naman werlices cynnes: hic Cato, huius Catonis; hic Milo appellativa synd gem\u00e6nelice: hic sermo \u00feeos spr\u00e6c, huius sermonis. Ealswa hic cudo \u00fees smi\u00f0, huius cudonis; spado, id est, eunuchus, \u00fe\u00e6t is, belisnod; tiro geong \u00deas o\u00f0re synd feminini generis: haec oratio \u00f0is gebed, huius orationis; actio d\u00e6d, lectio r\u00e6ding, iussio commvnis generis: hic et haec latro \u00f0es and \u00f0eos scea\u00f0a, huius latronis; ambo begen: ambo generis feminini ys \u00f0\u00e6re forman declinunge: ambae feminae butu \u00f0a wif,ambarum feminarum begra generis nevtri: ambo uerba butu \u00fea word, amborum uerborum et cetera. Ealswa ga\u00f0 duo twegen and duae twa. Fif naman synd mascvlini generis, \u00fee macia\u00f0 femininvm",
